-- ==========================================================
-- gatwd Tour: 1. Basics & Types
-- Run: ./gatwd examples/tour/01_basics.gatwd
-- ==========================================================
-- Welcome to Gophers All The Way Down! 
-- This DSL natively embraces pure Functional Programming.

-- 1. Algebraic Data Types
-- Define dynamic Sum types on the fly. The engine allocates BitFlags instantly.
type OS = Linux | Windows | Darwin
type Device = Mobile | Desktop | Server

-- 2. Spawning & The Trampoline
-- We spawn a Node and pipe ( |> ) it to the 'echo' command.
-- Because gatwd executes lazily via Trampolines, graphs can be infinite!
spawn Device: localhost |> echo Hello from %s!
